  "自查：在浏览器打开 {link}，确认看到的是你填好的地址和 key；改完后等 1–2 分钟，再按 Ctrl+F5（Mac：Cmd+Shift+R）强制刷新。": "Check: open {link} and confirm it shows your URL and key; after changing it, wait 1–2 minutes and hard-refresh with Ctrl+F5 (Mac: Cmd+Shift+R).",
  "自动（检测为{lang}）": "Auto (detected: {lang})", "繁體中文由简体自动转换；English 没有翻译到的文案会显示中文。物品名称等自己填写的内容不会翻译。": "Traditional Chinese is converted from Simplified automatically; untranslated English text falls back to Chinese. Your own entries, like item names, are never translated.",
