  "美制单位 lb、oz、fl oz、qt、gal": "US units lb, oz, fl oz, qt, gal", "公制单位 kg、g、斤、L、mL": "metric units kg, g, jin, L, mL",
  "已有物品按原单位保存，显示时自动换算；按“个、盒、袋”计数的物品不换算。": "Existing items keep their original unit and are converted for display; counted units like pc, box, bag are not converted.",
