  "机油机滤": "Oil and filter", "全合成可到 10,000 英里；短途多、极冷极热按 5,000。": "Full synthetic can go 10,000 miles; short trips or extreme temperatures, 5,000.", "轮胎轮换": "Tire rotation", "电车车重、扭矩大，更要按时换位；顺便看胎纹（4/32 英寸该换）和胎压。": "EVs are heavy with high torque, so rotate on time; check tread (replace at 4/32\") and pressure.",
  "空调 / 车内滤芯": "Cabin air filter", "自己换最简单，副驾手套箱后面。": "Easiest DIY job; it's behind the glove box.", "发动机空滤": "Engine air filter", "雨刮片": "Wiper blades", "入冬前换，玻璃水换防冻型。": "Replace before winter and switch to winter washer fluid.",
  "刹车油": "Brake fluid", "电车刹车片耐用，但刹车油照样吸水，2–3 年一换。": "EV brake pads last, but the fluid still absorbs water; change every 2–3 years.", "冷却液": "Coolant", "电车为电池 / 电机冷却液，按手册。": "For EVs this is battery / motor coolant; follow the manual.",
  "12V 小电瓶": "12V battery", "电车最常见的趴窝原因就是 12V 电瓶，3–4 年主动换。": "The 12V battery is the most common reason an EV won't start; replace proactively every 3–4 years.", "火花塞": "Spark plugs", "变速箱油": "Transmission fluid", "厂家说“终身免维护”的也建议 60k–100k 换。": "Even “lifetime” fluid is best changed at 60k–100k.",
  "四轮定位": "Wheel alignment", "跑偏、轮胎偏磨、撞过坑就做。": "Do it after pulling, uneven tire wear or a bad pothole.", "电池健康度记录": "Battery health log", "记一次满电续航或 SoH%，年年比较；高压电池保修通常 8 年 / 10 万英里。": "Note full-charge range or SoH% once a year and compare; HV battery warranty is usually 8 years / 100k miles.",
  "充电设备检查": "Charger check", "看家用充电桩线缆、插头有没有发热变色、松动。": "Check the home charger cable and plug for heat discoloration or looseness.", "召回查询": "Recall check", "NHTSA 网站按 VIN 查，召回维修免费。": "Look up the VIN on the NHTSA site; recall repairs are free.", "整车检查": "Full inspection", "刹车片厚度、悬挂、灯光、底盘漏油 / 漏液。": "Brake pad thickness, suspension, lights, leaks underneath.",
