  "例如：年会 3 月、储备金研究 2025、门禁码在钥匙盒": "e.g. annual meeting in March, reserve study 2025, gate code in the key box", "{label}须知（{type}）": "{label} notes ({type})",
  "没填 {label}，有的话去资料里补充": "No {label} recorded; add it in the home profile if you have one", "这种房型一般没有 {label}": "This home type usually has no {label}", "修改": "Edit",
  "联系方式": "Contact", "账单：{name}": "Bill: {name}", "建一条账单提醒缴费": "add a bill for payment reminders", "没有进行中的特殊评估": "No special assessment in progress", "截止 {d}": "due {d}",
  "已逾期 {d} 天": "{d} days overdue", "{d} 天后到期": "due in {d} days", "{d} 天后截止（{date}）": "Due in {d} days ({date})", "已逾期 {d} 天，逾期有滞纳金并可能留置": "{d} days overdue; late fees apply and a lien is possible", "标为已缴": "Mark paid",
  "不少郊区小区也有 HOA：管外观、围栏、房屋颜色、垃圾桶摆放；买房时核对 covenants（契约限制）。": "Many suburban subdivisions have an HOA too: exterior look, fences, paint colors, trash-can placement; check the covenants when buying.",
  "先看章程（Declaration / Bylaws）：外墙、屋顶、车道、围栏谁修；月费包含什么（水、垃圾、除雪、草坪）。": "Read the Declaration / Bylaws first: who repairs siding, roof, driveway, fences; what the dues cover (water, trash, snow, lawn).",
  "储备金（reserve）不够时会摊特殊评估（special assessment）；伊州买卖前要索取 22.1 披露和付清证明。": "When reserves run short a special assessment is levied; in Illinois request the 22.1 disclosure and paid assessment letter before selling.",
  "外观改动（门窗颜色、露台、卫星天线）通常要先提交审批。": "Exterior changes (door and window colors, decks, satellite dishes) usually need prior approval.",
  "月费通常含水、垃圾、公共区域保险（master policy）；户内和个人财产要自己买 HO-6 保险。": "Dues usually cover water, trash and the master insurance policy; buy your own HO-6 policy for the interior and belongings.",
  "特殊评估（special assessment）：储备金不够大修（屋顶、电梯、外墙、停车场）时按份额摊，可分期；伊州买卖要 22.1 披露。": "Special assessment: when reserves can't cover a major repair (roof, elevators, facade, parking) each unit pays its share, sometimes in installments; Illinois sales require the 22.1 disclosure.",
  "常见规则：宠物（数量、体重）、出租限制（rental cap、最短租期）、装修审批与施工时段、停车位、安静时段、搬家预约与押金。": "Common rules: pets (count, weight), rental caps and minimum lease terms, renovation approval and work hours, parking, quiet hours, move-in scheduling and deposits.",
  "每年看一次：预算、储备金研究（reserve study）、董事会会议记录、诉讼和保险续保情况。": "Review yearly: budget, reserve study, board minutes, litigation and insurance renewals.",
  "墙内管线、窗户、阳台的责任划分各楼不同，以章程为准。": "Responsibility for in-wall pipes, windows and balconies varies by building; the declaration governs.",
  "大楼规则（宠物、安静时段、搬家预约、包裹）和房东、物业的联系方式记在这里。": "Record building rules (pets, quiet hours, move-in scheduling, packages) and landlord / management contacts here.",
  "物业费按建筑面积、按季或按年预收；公共维修基金（大修基金）动用要业主表决。": "Fees are charged by floor area, prepaid quarterly or yearly; using the public repair fund requires an owners' vote.",
  "业委会 / 业主大会负责物业选聘、公共收益（广告、停车位）和维修基金使用。": "The owners' committee handles hiring management, common income (ads, parking) and repair-fund use.",
  "常见规则：装修押金与施工时段、垃圾分类、电动车充电、停车位管理、高空抛物。": "Common rules: renovation deposit and work hours, waste sorting, EV charging, parking, no throwing objects from height.",
  "老小区可能没有专业物业；屋面漏水、管道老化常需和邻居、社区、街道协调，旧改政策留意。": "Older complexes may have no professional management; roof leaks and aging pipes need coordination with neighbors and the community; watch renewal programs.",
  "外立面、小区道路、绿化归物业；露台、花园、围栏改动通常要报备。": "Facade, roads and landscaping belong to management; terrace, garden and fence changes usually need filing.",
  "物业费按面积；别墅区物业费标准和服务内容在物业服务合同里。": "Fees are by area; villa-district rates and services are in the management contract.",
  "小区道路、公共绿化、安保归物业；自家院内自己负责。": "Roads, shared landscaping and security belong to management; your own yard is yours.",

