  "伊州普通车约 $151 / 年（纯电 $251），到期月底前在线续，逾期罚款且排放没过不能续。到期月份在牌照贴纸上，建后补填；几辆车各建一条。": "Illinois: about $151 / year for a regular car ($251 for EVs); renew online before the end of the expiry month. Late fees apply, and a failed emissions test blocks renewal. The month is on the plate sticker; fill in the due date after creating, one bill per car.",
  "很多 village 和 Chicago 市要求另买本镇车贴，一年一次，$30–$100 不等，有的按住址寄通知、有的要自己上网买；不收的镇不用建。": "Many villages and the City of Chicago require a local vehicle sticker, once a year, $30–$100. Some mail a notice, some you buy online yourself; skip it if your town doesn't charge one.",
  "车船税多随交强险一起交；年检按车龄 6 年内免检、之后每年或每两年一次，到期月份看行驶证。": "Vehicle tax is usually paid with the compulsory insurance; inspection is waived for the first 6 years, then yearly or every two years. The month is on the registration.",
  "请选择": "Choose…", "记一次": "Log one", "请选保养项目（维修可不选）": "Pick a service item (not needed for repairs)", "保养 / 检查 / 更换必选，这一项的下次日期才会更新；维修可不选": "Required for service / inspection / replacement so that item's next date updates; optional for repairs",
  "还没记过这项，按购车 / 安装日期起算": "Not logged yet; counted from the purchase / install date", "按里程推算，现在约 {n} {u}": "Estimated by mileage; now about {n} {u}",
  "按月和按里程取先到的；里程按年均里程推算。记保养时要选对“保养项目”，那一项的下次日期才会更新": "Whichever comes first by months or mileage; mileage is projected from annual miles. Pick the right service item when logging, or that item's next date won't move",
