  "机票、住宿、门票、燃油…按行程汇总；记花费时填“所属行程”，补记以前的旅行也一样（日期选当时的）。": "Flights, lodging, tickets, fuel… totalled by trip. Fill in “Trip” when logging; back-fill past trips the same way (pick the original date).",
  "记一笔花费时，分类选“旅行出行”里的机票 / 住宿 / 门票…，并在“所属行程”里写个名字（例如 东京 2026）。以前的旅行也可以补记，日期选当时的。": "When logging spending, pick a category under Travel (flights / lodging / tickets…) and give it a trip name (e.g. Tokyo 2026). Past trips can be back-filled too — pick the original date.",
  "名称或商店里带机票、酒店、门票、加油…的“其他”花费；点一下归到对应类型（可在明细里再改，也可以给名称加上「【行程名】」）。": "“Other” spending whose name or store mentions flights, hotels, tickets, fuel…; tap to move it to the matching type (editable in Records; you can also prefix the name with 【Trip name】).",
  "机票、住宿、门票…按行程汇总": "Flights, lodging, tickets… by trip",
  "航空公司 / 酒店 / 旅行社 / 邮轮公司": "Airline / hotel / travel agency / cruise line",
