  "付款会自动并入 花费 的“旅行出行”分类（按小类拆：机票、住宿…）。": "Payments are added to Spending under Travel (split by type: flights, lodging…).",
  "还没执行数据库迁移 031（一次性账单加“旅行”种类），先在 Supabase 里执行 supabase/migrations/031_travel_bills.sql": "Database migration 031 (adds the Travel type to one-time bills) hasn't been run yet — run supabase/migrations/031_travel_bills.sql in Supabase first",
