  "{n} 个商家，可以改": "{n} merchants, editable",
  "从银行或信用卡网站下载交易记录（CSV 格式），选中文件。文件只在你的浏览器里处理，不会上传；只有你确认的那几笔会存成花费。": "Download your transactions (CSV) from your bank or card website and pick the file. It is processed in your browser only — nothing is uploaded; only the items you confirm are saved as spending.",
  "以前已经手动记过的花费（日期差 3 天内、金额一样）自动跳过，所以同一个文件导两次也不会重复。": "Spending you already logged by hand (same amount, within 3 days) is skipped automatically, so importing the same file twice does not duplicate it.",
  "信用卡还款、账户之间转账、工资入账不是花费，默认跳过——否则会重复算一遍。": "Card payments, transfers between accounts and paychecks are not spending and are skipped by default — otherwise they would be counted twice.",
  "信用卡还款、转账、收入默认不导入（不是花费）；和已有花费对得上的会自动跳过。": "Card payments, transfers and income are not imported by default (not spending); items matching existing spending are skipped.",
  "只有一笔刷卡 / 扣款、没有小票也没关系：按商家名自动归类（超市、餐饮、加油、水电网、订阅、机票酒店…），认不出的你选一次，之后记住。": "A single card charge with no receipt is fine: it is categorised by merchant name (groceries, dining, fuel, utilities, subscriptions, flights & hotels…). Pick a category once for anything unrecognised and it is remembered.",
