  "分类怎么选：买回家吃的、用的（会用完）→ 日常储备；买回家长期用的 → 装备；花钱买体验或服务、没有东西留在家里 → 外出与服务。银行流水里看不出买了什么的，超市算“超市杂货”（归日常储备），网购算“网购 / 综合购物（未细分）”。": "Which category? Things you bring home to eat or use up → Pantry stock; things you keep long-term → Gear; an experience or service with nothing left at home → Going out & services. When a bank line doesn't show what was bought, supermarkets count as “Groceries (unspecified)” (Pantry stock) and online shops as “Online / general shopping (unspecified)”.",
