  "从银行或信用卡网站下载对账单，选中文件：支持 CSV、Excel、OFX / QFX、QIF，以及 PDF 月结单、截图（PDF 先用本地规则读，读不准再用 AI）。可以一次选多个月。文件只在你的浏览器里处理；只有你点“用 AI 解析”才会把内容发给你设置的模型。": "Download statements from your bank or card website and pick the files: CSV, Excel, OFX / QFX, QIF, plus PDF monthly statements and screenshots (PDFs are read with local rules first, then AI if needed). You can pick several months at once. Files are processed in your browser; content goes to your chosen model only when you click “Parse with AI”.",
  "将把这份对账单里带日期或金额的行（已抹掉账号、卡号、邮箱、电话，没有姓名和地址）发给 {p} 来识别交易。继续？": "Only the lines with a date or amount from this statement (account / card numbers, emails and phone numbers removed; no names or addresses) will be sent to {p} to read the transactions. Continue?",
