  "一类一条：每处位置一行，写数量和备注（如“进水阀 2024 换过”）。坏了在保养记录里记，备注里写是哪一处。": "One record per kind: one line per location with count and a note (e.g. “fill valve replaced 2024”). Log repairs in the maintenance log and say which one.",
