  "设备 = 有保养周期或保修的，一台一条（热水器、割草机）；固定装置按类记一条（马桶、门、吊扇、插座），位置和数量写在里面；只记数量和位置的（梯子、床品、节日装饰）放在 储藏 → 装备；灯泡、电池是耗材，在 储藏 → 库存 → 房屋耗材。": "Equipment = things with a service interval or warranty, one record each (water heater, mower); fixtures are one record per kind (toilets, doors, ceiling fans, outlets) with locations and counts inside; things you only count and locate (ladders, bedding, holiday decor) go to Pantry → Gear; bulbs and batteries are supplies under Pantry → Inventory → Home supplies.",
